  "title": "Maime S NDE 7179",
  "date": "April 1997",
  "content": "My husband pushed me back and the chair fell backwards. I remember the tunnel, but it isn't like many describe it. It was more like the tunnel is flowing over me. Each place I looked, there are pieces of my life playing back. I saw experiences I had not remembered. The feeling was absolute peace and calm. I found myself loving that I could almost feel. I felt the emotions with each ‘movie’ experience of my life I was watching. In these experiences I was with family that had passed and some that had not. There were lots of experiences from when I was very young. It was a feeling of safety and love. Far away in the distance, I could faintly hear my name being called. When I turned to tell the person calling my name to please hush so I could carry on this amazing experience I was jolted back into my body. With that, they managed to get a heartbeat. My husband said he had been shouting my name yet it was so distant. I had to have this experience, as a month later, my young son drowned. By the absolute knowledge of total belief gained from my experience, he is now a gifted child who survived 28 minutes without breath and was declared clinically dead. As a result we both experience spiritual contact and have psychic abilities.",
